=C2=A0



=C2=A0
Ollama now supports Hermes Desktop, the desktop app for =
Hermes Agent by Nous Research. It works with Ollama's local and cloud
models directly.
=C2=A0
Hermes Agent has lived in the terminal until now. =
Hermes Desktop brings the same self-improving agent into a desktop app for
macOS, Windows, and Linux: it writes its own Python skills as you work, =
spins up parallel subagents, and connects to Slack,
Discord, Telegram, and more.
=C2=A0


Get started

Download Ollama =
[https://ollama.com/download] and run:
=C2=A0
ollama launch hermes-desktop



Here are some models to try with Hermes Desktop:
 * minimax-m3:cloud

 * kimi-k2.6:cloud

 * qwen3.6:27b

 * gemma4:12b

 * gemma4:26b

If you are on using Apple silicon, you can try the models via MLX
 * qwen3.6:27b-mlx

 * gemma4:26b-mlx

=C2=A0
If you have any feedback, =
reply directly to this email or join Ollama=E2=80=99s Discord =
[https://discord.gg/ollama].
=C2=A0
=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F Ollama
